      "AIR NEW ZEALAND\nSouth Pacific and Orient Routes Buffet Prices\nNew Zealand currency is acceptable on all AIR NEW ZEALAND sectors\n(Prices listed are minimum allowed by International Air Transport Association in this area\nBeer\nStout\nSpirits\nSherry\nVermouth\nLiqueurs\nWines\nCocktails\nCans\nSmall Bottles\nMiniatures\nMiniatures\nMiniatures\nMiniatures\n* Bottles\nPer Glass\nPer Glass\nNew Zealand\nGuinness\nWhisky Scotch\nWhiskey Rye\nWhiskey Bourbon\nGin\nVodka\nRum Bacardi\nCognac\nSweet or Dry\nSweet or Dry\nCherry Brandy\nCognac\nBenedictine\nDrambuie\nCreme de Menthe\nCointreau\nGrand Marnier\nChampagne\nRed\nWhite\nChampagne\nRed\nWhite\nAs Ordered\nN.Z. AUST.\nUSA\n18c\n18c\n28c\n28c\n28c\n28c\n28c\n28c\n28c\n18c\n18c\n28c\n28c\n45c\n45c\n45c\n45c\n45c\n60c\n30c\n30c\n50c\n25c\n25c\n28c\n21c\n21 c\n31c\n31c\n31c\n31c\n31c\n31c\n31c\n21c\n21c\n31c\n31c\n50c\n50c\n50c\n50c\n50c\n67c\n34c\n34c\n560\n28c\n28c\n31c\nSTERLING\n1s 8d\nIs\n8d\n2s\n2s\n2s\n2s\n2s\n2s\n7d\n7d\n7d\n7d\n7d\n7d\n7d\n1s\n8d\nIs\n8d\n2s\n2s\n4s\n4s\n4s\n4s\n4s\n7d\n7d\n3d\n3d\n3d\n3d\n3d\n5s\n7d\n2s 10d\n2s 10d\n4s\n8d\n2s\n4d\n2s\n4d\n2s 7d\nMineral Waters (complimentary): Coca Cola, Lemon \u0026 Paeroa, Tonic Water, Ginger Ale,\nBitter Lemon, Soda Water, Orange Juice.\nPlease note that the sale of all items must be discontinued before descent in order that the Bar\ncontents may be checked and recorded in readiness for Customs inspection after landing."
